// MailScreen: a mail app's layout. What it is, by width:
//
// - A desktop (a window at least fn mailWideFrom() wide) shows three panes at once. The rail down the window's
//   start is the kit's SideNav: the product's mark and name, Compose under them (Compose is where a person starts,
//   so it sits at the top of the folders, as the rail's own control), the folders with their counts, the account.
//   Beside it, on the page, the kit's MessageList: the folder's name and unread count, the messages, and its own
//   reading pane, which holds the open message (who and when, the subject, the body). Over the list, a toolbar
//   with the open message's actions (Reply, Reply all, Forward, and Flag, which an agent may set too). MessageList draws its reading pane itself on any window wider
//   than a phone, so the screen uses that pane as its third and does not draw a second copy of the message beside
//   it: the open message's body is passed in as its row's preview (`snippet`), so the pane reads it whole while
//   the row still shows its first line, as a mail list does.
// - A phone shows one pane at a time, the one `which` names: the folders (SideNav, full width), the list
//   (MessageList, which draws the list alone on a phone) or the open message (drawn here: the subject, the sender
//   with their address, the recipients, the body and the reply actions), each under the kit's TopBar (the
//   product's name and Compose), and the list and the message with Back at their start. Back is drawn here, not in
//   TopBar: TopBar's slot follows its title, and Back leads.
//
// States:
//   data   many|empty|loading|failed|long, for the list (the folders keep their places while the list loads):
//          MessageList says each in its own room with its way on (empty: write a message; failed: Try again, the
//          state's one fill, so Compose steps back to plain); loading breathes rows in the real rows' shape and
//          offers no reply action, for there is nothing open to answer. A phone asked for the message while
//          there is none to open shows the list's state instead, so a person is never on an empty page. long:
//          every word at length (folders cut with an ellipsis; subject, sender, recipients and body wrap).
//   agent  none|proposed|changed|waiting, an assistant's act on the mail, through the other door, said in one
//          band over the panes (the same band on a phone and a desktop, so what waits is held in one place):
//          proposed: its sentence and two answer words (Accept is the state's one fill); changed: its sentence
//          and Undo, and the message it changed carries MessageList's accent mark and `agentNote` on its row;
//          waiting: what the assistant waits for, marked in the caution colour with a clock, and the way to it
//          (`waitingLabel`, plain: the person goes when they choose; nothing is decided by the press).
//   Flag   the open message's flag is a value (its row's `flagged`): the person's Flag and an agent's tool set the
//          same one, and an agent's flag carries its mark on the row and its band with Undo (agent changed).
//   which  list|message|folders: the pane a phone shows (a desktop shows all three).
// Every word is the app's; every value a Theme token or a screens.mail-* size. The words of a band take ink on
// the surface (another party's theme need not hold a status colour as text on a tint); the band's start edge and
// glyph carry its tone.
use Words, ActionButton from "__SCOPE__/components"
use TopBar, SideNav, NavEntry, MessageList, Message from "__SCOPE__/blocks"

// One folder: its key, its name, where it opens, the group it sits in ("" for none), and how many unread
// messages it holds (0 shows no count).
shape MailFolder
  key: string
  label: string
  href: string
  group: string
  count: number

// The open message: its key (the list's row with the same key is the chosen one), who sent it and from which
// address, who it went to, when, its subject and its whole body.
shape MailLetter
  key: string
  from: string
  address: string
  to: string
  when: string
  subject: string
  body: string

// The one viewport fact the screen reads.
shape MailViewport
  width: number

// The least window width that holds the rail (screens.mail-rail) beside a list and its reading pane.
fn mailWideFrom(): number = 900

// Back, at the start of a phone's pane: the accent chevron and the name of the pane it goes back to. Its name says
// `label` then the pane's name ("Back to" "Inbox"), so a screen reader hears what it does.
component MailBack
  props
    label: string
    target: string
    press: action
    testId: string
  view
    row
      button press=press testId=testId aria-label=`${label} ${target}` display="flex" flex-direction="row" align-items="center" gap="theme.space.xs" min-width=0 min-height="screens.mail-tap" padding-left="0" padding-right="theme.space.sm" border-width=0 border-radius="theme.radius.control" background-color="transparent" color="theme.color.accent"
        :hover
          opacity=0.8
        :focus-visible
          box-shadow="0 0 0 2px theme.color.focus"
        svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="screens.mail-glyph" height="screens.mail-glyph" fill="none" stroke="theme.color.accent" aria-hidden=true flex-shrink=0
          path d="M10 3L5 8l5 5" stroke-width=1.75 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
        text target min-width=0 font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.accent" white-space="nowrap" overflow="hidden" text-overflow="ellipsis"

// What an assistant did or asks, in one band: its glyph and sentence, then its answers (the slot), which wrap under
// the sentence when the sentence would fall under its least width. Proposed and changed take the accent's edge
// (the kit's agent mark, as LinkRow draws it), waiting the caution's edge and a clock. The words are ink on the
// surface; the frame is the line token, so the band shows on a theme whose page and surface are one colour.
component MailBand
  props
    tone: enum<"proposed", "changed", "waiting">
    sentence: string
    testId: string
  slot
  view
    row testId=testId role="status" flex-wrap="wrap" align-items="center" column-gap="theme.space.lg" row-gap="theme.space.md" padding-top="theme.space.md" padding-bottom="theme.space.md" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.md" box-sizing="border-box" background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.line" border-left-width="screens.mail-mark-line" border-left-color=(tone == "waiting" ? "theme.color.caution" : "theme.color.accent")
      row flex=1 min-width="screens.mail-band-min" align-items="flex-start" gap="theme.space.sm"
        svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="screens.mail-glyph" height="screens.mail-glyph" margin-top="screens.mail-glyph-top" fill="none" aria-hidden=true flex-shrink=0
          if tone == "waiting"
            circle cx=8 cy=8 r=6 stroke="theme.color.caution" stroke-width=1.5
            path d="M8 4.8V8l2.2 1.4" stroke="theme.color.caution" stroke-width=1.5 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
          else if tone == "changed"
            circle cx=8 cy=8 r=6.5 fill="theme.color.accent"
            path d="M5 8.2l2 2 4-4.4" stroke="theme.color.accent-ink" stroke-width=1.6 stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
          else
            path d="M8 1.5l1.5 5 5 1.5-5 1.5-1.5 5-1.5-5-5-1.5 5-1.5z" fill="theme.color.accent"
        text sentence testId=`${testId}-sentence` flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.body" color="theme.color.ink" overflow-wrap="anywhere"
      row flex-wrap="wrap" gap="theme.space.sm" flex-shrink=0
        children

// The assistant's band for this state, the same on a phone and a desktop.
component MailAgent
  props
    agent: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed", "waiting">
    proposedNote: string
    changedNote: string
    waitingNote: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    undoLabel: string
    waitingLabel: string
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    review: action
  view
    if agent == "proposed"
      MailBand(tone="proposed", sentence=proposedNote, testId="mail-proposal")
        ActionButton(label=rejectLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=reject, testId="mail-reject")
        ActionButton(label=acceptLabel, kind="primary", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=accept, testId="mail-accept")
    else if agent == "changed"
      MailBand(tone="changed", sentence=changedNote, testId="mail-changed")
        ActionButton(label=undoLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=undo, testId="mail-undo")
    else if agent == "waiting"
      MailBand(tone="waiting", sentence=waitingNote, testId="mail-waiting")
        ActionButton(label=waitingLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=review, testId="mail-review")

// The actions on the open message: Reply, Reply all, Forward, then Flag (a value an agent may set too, so the
// button says it is pressed while the message is flagged, and its words, `flagLabel`, are the app's for that
// state). `focal` fills Reply when it is the pane's one thing to do (a phone's open message); on a desktop's
// toolbar every one stays plain beside Compose.
component MailReplies
  props
    replyLabel: string
    replyAllLabel: string
    forwardLabel: string
    flagLabel: string
    flagged: bool
    focal: bool
    reply: action
    replyAll: action
    forward: action
    flag: action
  view
    row flex-wrap="wrap" gap="theme.space.sm"
      ActionButton(label=replyLabel, kind=(focal ? "primary" : "plain"), interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=reply, testId="mail-reply")
      ActionButton(label=replyAllLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=replyAll, testId="mail-reply-all")
      ActionButton(label=forwardLabel, kind="plain", interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=forward, testId="mail-forward")
      button press=flag testId="mail-flag" aria-pressed=flagged display="flex" flex-direction="row" align-items="center" gap="theme.space.sm" min-height="screens.mail-tap" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.lg" border-radius="theme.radius.control" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color=(flagged ? "theme.color.caution" : "theme.color.line") background-color="theme.color.surface" color="theme.color.ink"
        :hover
          background-color="theme.color.hover"
        :active
          background-color="theme.color.fill"
        :focus-visible
          box-shadow="0 0 0 2px theme.color.focus"
        svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="screens.mail-glyph" height="screens.mail-glyph" fill="none" aria-hidden=true flex-shrink=0
          path d="M4.5 2.5v11" stroke=(flagged ? "theme.color.caution" : "theme.color.ink-muted") stroke-width=1.75 stroke-linecap="round"
          path d="M5.5 3.5H13l-2.8 3 2.8 3H5.5z" fill=(flagged ? "theme.color.caution" : "none") stroke=(flagged ? "theme.color.caution" : "theme.color.ink-muted") stroke-width=1.25 stroke-linejoin="round"
        text flagLabel font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink"

// The open message on a phone: one card, as MessageList's own, in three bands. The subject first, at title size
// (the pane's focal words), with the sender under it (a round initial, the name and when on one line, the
// address, then the recipients after `toLabel`); the body next, wrapping and keeping the app's own line breaks;
// last the reply actions, on their own band, attached to the words they answer.
component MailLetterCard
  props
    letter: MailLetter
    toLabel: string
    replyLabel: string
    replyAllLabel: string
    forwardLabel: string
    flagLabel: string
    flagged: bool
    reply: action
    replyAll: action
    forward: action
    flag: action
  view
    column testId="mail-letter" role="article" aria-label=letter.subject min-width=0 background-color="theme.color.surface" border-radius="theme.radius.card" border-width="theme.line.width" border-style="solid" border-color="theme.color.line" overflow="hidden"
      column gap="theme.space.lg" padding="theme.space.lg" border-bottom-width="theme.line.width" border-bottom-style="solid" border-bottom-color="theme.color.line"
        column overflow-wrap="anywhere"
          Words(text=letter.subject, kind="title", outcome="none", level=2, testId="mail-letter-subject")
        row gap="theme.space.md" align-items="flex-start"
          column width="screens.mail-avatar" height="screens.mail-avatar" flex-shrink=0 align-items="center" justify-content="center" border-radius="theme.radius.pill" background-color="theme.color.fill" aria-hidden=true
            text letter.from.trim().slice(0, 1) font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink"
          column flex=1 min-width=0 gap="theme.space.xs"
            row align-items="baseline" gap="theme.space.md"
              text letter.from testId="mail-letter-from" flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.label" color="theme.color.ink" overflow-wrap="anywhere"
              text letter.when testId="mail-letter-when" flex-shrink=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted" white-space="nowrap"
            if letter.address != ""
              text letter.address testId="mail-letter-address" font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted" overflow-wrap="anywhere"
            if letter.to != ""
              row gap="theme.space.xs" align-items="baseline"
                text toLabel flex-shrink=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink-muted"
                text letter.to testId="mail-letter-to" flex=1 min-width=0 font="theme.type.caption" color="theme.color.ink" overflow-wrap="anywhere"
      column padding="theme.space.lg"
        text letter.body testId="mail-letter-body" font="theme.type.body" color="theme.color.ink" white-space="pre-line" overflow-wrap="anywhere"
      row padding="theme.space.lg" border-top-width="theme.line.width" border-top-style="solid" border-top-color="theme.color.line"
        MailReplies(replyLabel=replyLabel, replyAllLabel=replyAllLabel, forwardLabel=forwardLabel, flagLabel=flagLabel, flagged=flagged, focal=true, reply=reply, replyAll=replyAll, forward=forward, flag=flag)

component MailScreen
  props
    title: string
    mark: string
    navLabel: string
    foldersTitle: string
    folderTitle: string
    accountName: string
    accountDetail: string
    composeLabel: string
    backLabel: string
    unreadLabel: string
    orderLabel: string
    paneLabel: string
    paneEmptyText: string
    paneQuietText: string
    emptyText: string
    failedText: string
    retryLabel: string
    toolbarLabel: string
    toLabel: string
    replyLabel: string
    replyAllLabel: string
    forwardLabel: string
    flagLabel: string
    unflagLabel: string
    agentNote: string
    proposedNote: string
    acceptLabel: string
    rejectLabel: string
    changedNote: string
    undoLabel: string
    waitingNote: string
    waitingLabel: string
    folders: MailFolder[]
    folderKey: string
    messages: Message[]
    letter: MailLetter
    agentKey: string
    data: enum<"many", "empty", "loading", "failed", "long">
    agent: enum<"none", "proposed", "changed", "waiting">
    which: enum<"list", "message", "folders">
    compose: action
    retry: action
    reply: action
    replyAll: action
    forward: action
    flag: action
    showFolders: action
    showList: action
    accept: action
    reject: action
    undo: action
    review: action
  resource viewport = exactViewport() as shape MailViewport
  derive wide = viewport.width >= mailWideFrom()
  derive shown = data == "many" or data == "long"
  derive open = shown and messages.filter(m => m.key == letter.key).length > 0
  // The pane a phone shows: the one `which` names, but the list's own state while there is no message to open.
  // The open message's flag, from its row: one value, whichever door set it.
  derive openFlagged = messages.filter(m => m.key == letter.key and m.flagged).length > 0
  derive pane = which == "message" and not open ? "list" : which
  // The open message's body is its row's preview, so MessageList's reading pane reads it whole.
  derive listed = messages.map(m => m.key == letter.key ? Message(m, snippet=letter.body) : m)
  derive entries = folders.map(f => NavEntry(key=f.key, label=f.label, href=f.href, group=f.group, badge=f.count, current=(f.key == folderKey)))
  // One fill per state: Compose, unless failed's Try again, an assistant's Accept or a phone's Reply is the act.
  derive composeFocal = data != "failed" and agent != "proposed" and (wide or pane != "message")
  view
    if wide
      row testId="mail" position="absolute" inset=0 display="flex" align-items="stretch" background-color="theme.color.page" color="theme.color.ink"
        scroll id="mail-rail" width="screens.mail-rail" flex-shrink=0 min-height=0 background-color="theme.color.surface"
          column min-height="100%"
            SideNav(productName=title, productMark=mark, navLabel=navLabel, entries=entries, data="many", emptyText="", emptyLabel="", empty=compose, loadingText="", failedText="", retryLabel="", retry=retry, accountName=accountName, accountDetail=accountDetail, agent="none", agentKey="", agentNote="", testId="mail-folders")
              ActionButton(label=composeLabel, kind=(composeFocal ? "primary" : "plain"), interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=compose, testId="mail-compose")
            box flex=1 border-right-width="theme.line.width" border-right-style="solid" border-right-color="theme.color.line" aria-hidden=true
        scroll id="mail-main" flex=1 min-width=0 min-height=0
          column role="main" padding="theme.space.xl" gap="theme.space.lg"
            if shown
              MailAgent(agent=agent, proposedNote=proposedNote, changedNote=changedNote, waitingNote=waitingNote, acceptLabel=acceptLabel, rejectLabel=rejectLabel, undoLabel=undoLabel, waitingLabel=waitingLabel, accept=accept, reject=reject, undo=undo, review=review)
            if open
              row role="group" aria-label=toolbarLabel testId="mail-toolbar" justify-content="flex-end"
                MailReplies(replyLabel=replyLabel, replyAllLabel=replyAllLabel, forwardLabel=forwardLabel, flagLabel=(openFlagged ? unflagLabel : flagLabel), flagged=openFlagged, focal=false, reply=reply, replyAll=replyAll, forward=forward, flag=flag)
            MessageList(title=folderTitle, unreadLabel=unreadLabel, emptyText=emptyText, failedText=failedText, composeLabel=composeLabel, retryLabel=retryLabel, orderLabel=orderLabel, paneLabel=paneLabel, paneEmptyText=paneEmptyText, paneQuietText=paneQuietText, openLabel="", agentNote=agentNote, chosenKey=(open ? letter.key : ""), agentKey=agentKey, data=data, agent=(agent == "changed" ? "changed" : "none"), messages=listed, compose=compose, retry=retry, openMessage=reply, testId="mail-list")
    else
      column testId="mail" position="absolute" inset=0 display="flex" flex-direction="column" background-color="theme.color.page" color="theme.color.ink"
        TopBar(title=title, agentNote="", agent="none")
          ActionButton(label=composeLabel, kind=(composeFocal ? "primary" : "plain"), interaction="idle", outcome="none", press=compose, testId="mail-compose")
        scroll id="mail-scroll" flex=1 min-height=0
          column role="main" width="100%" max-width="screens.mail-pane-max" margin-left="auto" margin-right="auto" box-sizing="border-box" padding-left="theme.space.lg" padding-right="theme.space.lg" padding-top="theme.space.sm" padding-bottom="theme.space.xl" gap="theme.space.md"
            if pane == "list"
              MailBack(label=backLabel, target=foldersTitle, press=showFolders, testId="mail-back")
            else if pane == "message"
              MailBack(label=backLabel, target=folderTitle, press=showList, testId="mail-back")
            if shown
              MailAgent(agent=agent, proposedNote=proposedNote, changedNote=changedNote, waitingNote=waitingNote, acceptLabel=acceptLabel, rejectLabel=rejectLabel, undoLabel=undoLabel, waitingLabel=waitingLabel, accept=accept, reject=reject, undo=undo, review=review)
            if pane == "folders"
              column padding-top="theme.space.sm"
                SideNav(productName=foldersTitle, productMark="", navLabel=navLabel, entries=entries, data="many", emptyText="", emptyLabel="", empty=compose, loadingText="", failedText="", retryLabel="", retry=retry, accountName=accountName, accountDetail=accountDetail, agent="none", agentKey="", agentNote="", testId="mail-folders")
            else if pane == "message"
              MailLetterCard(letter=letter, toLabel=toLabel, replyLabel=replyLabel, replyAllLabel=replyAllLabel, forwardLabel=forwardLabel, flagLabel=(openFlagged ? unflagLabel : flagLabel), flagged=openFlagged, reply=reply, replyAll=replyAll, forward=forward, flag=flag)
            else
              MessageList(title=folderTitle, unreadLabel=unreadLabel, emptyText=emptyText, failedText=failedText, composeLabel=composeLabel, retryLabel=retryLabel, orderLabel=orderLabel, paneLabel=paneLabel, paneEmptyText=paneEmptyText, paneQuietText=paneQuietText, openLabel="", agentNote=agentNote, chosenKey="", agentKey=agentKey, data=data, agent=(agent == "changed" ? "changed" : "none"), messages=listed, compose=compose, retry=retry, openMessage=reply, testId="mail-list")
